{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And You have not made known to me.</b> The meaning: You said, ״הנה מלאכי ילך לפניך״ — and not only is it not Your intent to go with us, but even that angel You said would go with me, You did not make known to me who he is, but only unspecified. And there is no person in the world who does not have an angel that goes with him, as it is said: ״כי מלאכיו יצוה לך״. And even to Eliezer, servant of Abraham, He sent an angel, as it is written: ״הוא ישלח מלאכו לפניך״. ״And You said״ etc. — what good will You do me, that I have found favor in Your eyes?"], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:35.108179465Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}